{
  "v": 1,
  "about": "The packs of the Homie starter library v0, built by scripts/library.mjs (fetch, then build). CC0 only: the build reads each pack's own licence text first and refuses a pack whose text does not say CC0. Chosen for small multiplayer games played on phones: low-poly packs that look right together, rigged and animated characters, modular kit pieces, and a short shelf of real-world props, materials and skies. A pack marked srgbFactors (Kenney's 2020 exports) stores its flat colours as sRGB where glTF reads linear; the build converts them so they draw as the pack's own previews show them. In \"select\" the first glob that matches a file decides its kind and tier: kit pieces (1,000 triangles), props (1,500), signature pieces (5,000), heroes and characters (8,000).",
  "packs": [
    { "id":"kenney-cube-pets","label":"Kenney Cube Pets","family":"kenney","author":"Kenney","url":"https://kenney.nl/assets/cube-pets","license":"cc0","kind":"creature","tier":"prop","theme":["animal","pet","cute"],
      "source": {"kind":"kenney","slug":"cube-pets"},
      "select": [
